    <p class="eyebrow">Research</p>
    <h1 data-split data-split-delay="120">Studying real conditions, not theoretical assumptions</h1>
    <p class="lede">ARIES gathers direct insight from individuals, communities, and
    institutions, exploring patterns in behaviour, perception, systems, and societal
    gaps that conventional studies often overlook.</p>
