      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Establish a data-driven system for future initiatives</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Convert insights into actionable initiatives</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Increase awareness and engagement with Amaze Consortium</div>
      <div class="criteria-item"><span class="chk">&#10003;</span> Expand community and perception</div>
